          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "یہی (yihī) is yih, \"this\", with the emphatic -hī: \"this one and no other\". CDIAL lists Hindi yah, \"this\", under Sanskrit eṣa, \"this\" (CDIAL 2530)."
